        "executes" : false,
        "heading" : "Anti-Patterns",
        "line" : 51,
        "lines" : [
          "Don't skip publishing a postmortem for a sev3 incident because the tier",
          "only cares about sev1 counts. Every incident this skill fetches gets a",
          "postmortem; the tier classification is a summary on top, not a filter",
          "Don't hand-adjust the tier in the rendered report to match what",
          "leadership expects to hear. The floor in the tiers table is the honest",
          "bar; move the bar in the table if it's genuinely wrong, not in the output"
        ],
        "role" : "reference"
